modal\nOpen media 3 in modal\nOpen media 4 in modal\nOpen media 5 in modal\nOpen media 6 in modal\n1\n/\nof\n6\nTR2 ST 750W\nTR2 ST 750W\nSKU:PS-TRS-0750NNSAWE-T\n80 PLUS® 230V Standard Certified APFC non-modular PSU.\nView full details\nDesign\nSpecification\nDownload\nHow-to Videos\nTR2 ST 750W  Incorporating various high-quality components, the TR2 ST Series, saves energy through its high efficiency of up to 86% and accommodates any mainstream build with the most demanding requirements. An embedded fluid bearing fan delivers excellent airflow at an exceptionally low noise level. Additionally, the single +12V rail design enables non-stop usage with stable and reliable performance.  Ultra Quiet 120mm Fan TR2 ST Series adopts 120mm fluid bearing fan to guarantee cool performance and silent operation.  80 PLUS 230V Standard Certified  TR2 ST Series saves energy through its high energy efficiency of up to 86% and is 80 PLUS® 230V Standard certified.  Multiple Connectors  The cables used for TR2 ST Series are black and low-profile, users are able to properly route the cables in optimal location to prevent airflow blockage. Connector Type Connector Quantity Cable Quantity  Cable Length Main Power(24Pin) X 1 X 1450mm ATX 12V(4+4Pin) X 2 X 1550mm+150mm PCIe(6+2Pin) X 2 X 1450mm+150mm SATA (5Pin) X 6 X 2450mm+150mm +150mm+150mm Peripheral (4Pin) X 4 X 1450mm+150mm +150mm+150mm FDD Adapter X 1 X 1150mm  High-Quality Components High quality components enable non-stop usage with stable and reliable performance, no more capacitor explosion and leakage.  High amperage Single +12V Rail & DC to DC Design  TR2 ST Series is equipped with powerful +12V rails, superior performance under all types of system loading. The use of DC to DC circuit design provides very stable operation and enhanced voltage regulation. AC INPUTInput Voltage: 200-240V～  Input Current: 8A  Frequency: 50Hz/60Hz DC OUTPUT+3.3V+5V+12V-12V+5VSBMax Output Current18A18A62.5A0.3A3AMax Output Power110W750W3.6W15WTota